sections.text:
• Vozila sa linije 18N će u oba smeru, saobraćati ulicama: Milutina Milankovića, Antifašističke borbe, Jurija Gagarina, Marka Hristića, Bulevar Crvene Armije i dalje redovnom trasom;
• Vozila sa linije br. 460, 460A, 464A, 465, 465A, 466A, 493, 493A, 493B, 494, 494A, 499, 581, 581A, 581E, 4414A i 493N će u smeru ka periferijama saobraćati ulicama, Marka Hristića, Jurija Gagarina, Antifašističke borbe, Bulevar Arsenije Čarnojevića i dalje redovnim trasama, dok će u surpotnom smeru saobraćati redovnim trasama;
• Vozila sa linije br. 860I će u oba smera,  saobraćati ulicama Marka Hristića, Jurija Gagarina, Antifašističke borbe, Milutna Milankovića, Španskih boraca i dalje redovnom trasom.

text_translations.en:
• Vehicles from line 18N will travel in both directions on the streets: Milutin Milankovića, Anti-Fascist Struggle, Jurij Gagarin, Marko Hristić, Bulevar Crvena Armija and further along the regular route;
• Vehicles from line no. 460, 460A, 464A, 465, 465A, 466A, 493, 493A, 493B, 494, 494A, 499, 581, 581A, 581E, 4414A and 493N will travel in the direction of the suburbs on the streets Marko Hristić, Jurij Gagarin, Anti-fascist struggles, Arsenije Čarnojevića Boulevard will continue on regular routes, while traffic in the opposite direction will be on regular routes;
• Vehicles from line no. 860I will run in both directions on the streets of Marko Hristić, Jurij Gagarin, Anti-Fascist Struggle, Milutno Milanković, Španski borac and further along the regular route.

